WEBVTT

00:00:04.243 --> 00:00:11.387
Candy saw the vision of Anthony riding a horse.

00:00:15.592 --> 00:00:19.217
It turned out that Candy mistook Terry for Anthony.

00:00:21.173 --> 00:00:25.942
Terry carried unconscious Candy to the nurse's room.

00:00:26.227 --> 00:00:32.865
A treasure which caused anger.

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:54.599
I'd like to thank Terry for what he did,
but I have no idea where to find him...

00:00:54.865 --> 00:00:56.617
Kurin is probably tired of waiting for me!

00:01:04.765 --> 00:01:05.578
There she goes!

00:01:11.559 --> 00:01:12.582
She's alone...

00:01:12.583 --> 00:01:14.994
Candy keeps sneaking around alone...

00:01:15.029 --> 00:01:17.924
I'm telling you, she saw something bad and
now she's keeping it a secret!

00:01:18.427 --> 00:01:20.180
If that's true...

00:01:20.215 --> 00:01:21.720
...this could become interesting!

00:01:23.542 --> 00:01:24.385
There she is!

00:01:27.976 --> 00:01:32.464
Alright. Let's follow her and find
out what's she been up to!

00:01:33.454 --> 00:01:34.049
Neil!

00:01:42.921 --> 00:01:43.658
Terry!

00:01:43.909 --> 00:01:47.294
You wimps want to find out a girl's secret?

00:01:47.872 --> 00:01:51.046
Secret? Candy's secret?

00:01:54.106 --> 00:01:56.578
This has nothing to do with you!
Move!

00:01:56.682 --> 00:01:58.646
Why don't you try to move me yourself?

00:01:58.681 --> 00:02:00.513
Shit!
Get him!

00:02:13.627 --> 00:02:15.608
What's the matter?
Get up!

00:02:15.745 --> 00:02:17.100
I'll remember this!

00:02:27.442 --> 00:02:29.429
The leaves have already grown this big.

00:02:33.246 --> 00:02:36.384
The other Pony's hill is getting greener,
isn't it, Kurin?

00:02:38.644 --> 00:02:39.958
May...

00:02:39.993 --> 00:02:45.065
...the time when this refreshing breeze
blows over the actual Pony's hill, as well.

00:02:58.299 --> 00:02:59.784
Sister Pony!

00:03:00.369 --> 00:03:01.360
Sister Pony!

00:03:01.361 --> 00:03:07.391
My, my, sister Lane! What's the matter?
You don't usually get this upset.

00:03:07.426 --> 00:03:11.237
I'm sorry, sister Pony! It's because
we received letters from Annie and Candy!

00:03:11.272 --> 00:03:14.401
From both of them?! Hurry, hurry!
Let's read them!

00:03:24.043 --> 00:03:28.255
-It seems that Candy is doing so well!
-Annie, too.

00:03:28.290 --> 00:03:35.748
I'm glad that Annie stopped hiding the
fact that she was raised in Pony's home.

00:03:35.783 --> 00:03:37.391
Probably with Candy's help.

00:03:37.426 --> 00:03:42.625
Candy was always the one who kept
giving her strength and happiness.

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:45.243
That's right. And to us, as well.

00:03:47.663 --> 00:03:53.139
-I'd like Candy to become even happier.
-That's right, sister Lane.

00:03:53.368 --> 00:04:00.787
Candy sounded so excited in her letter.
She said, "I'm going to be even happier now."

00:04:04.104 --> 00:04:07.762
The letters which both Annie and I sent
must have arrived by now.

00:04:08.005 --> 00:04:09.382
Candy!

00:04:09.383 --> 00:04:10.759
Candy!

00:04:12.346 --> 00:04:14.497
Candy, where are you?

00:04:15.861 --> 00:04:17.131
It's Patty.

00:04:17.284 --> 00:04:18.498
Kurin, hide!

00:04:19.351 --> 00:04:21.221
Patty, I'm here!

00:04:28.475 --> 00:04:30.922
-So this is where you were, Candy!
-That's right!

00:04:31.964 --> 00:04:35.486
-I'm jealous of you.
-How come?

00:04:36.737 --> 00:04:41.186
It's because you can easily
handle anything on your own.

00:04:43.304 --> 00:04:45.693
-Candy?
-What is it?

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:49.601
Candy, are you ever lonely?

00:04:49.995 --> 00:04:52.890
Of course!
When I'm lonely, I come to this place!

00:04:53.311 --> 00:04:54.843
-Here?
-Yes!

00:04:54.948 --> 00:04:57.839
This place looks exactly like my Pony's hill,
where I grew up.

00:04:57.874 --> 00:05:00.792
On Pony's hill, there is my father-tree to whom
I could tell anything that's been on my mind!

00:05:00.976 --> 00:05:02.116
Your father-tree?

00:05:02.571 --> 00:05:05.771
Yes. And this tree looks just like my father-tree.

00:05:06.648 --> 00:05:10.212
That's how I came to call this place;
"The other Pony's hill".

00:05:10.418 --> 00:05:11.880
The other Pony's hill?

00:05:11.915 --> 00:05:12.600
Yes!

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:20.320
Yeah, yeah!

00:05:20.321 --> 00:05:23.879
If you ever get lonely, you can climb this tree
and it'll listen to anything you'd like to say!

00:05:24.516 --> 00:05:26.807
So that was Candy's secret?

00:05:30.129 --> 00:05:32.231
I, too, have a secret.

00:05:32.232 --> 00:05:32.936
Patty, you?

00:05:32.937 --> 00:05:35.099
-Yeah! My secret treasure!

00:05:35.134 --> 00:05:36.786
-A treasure?
-That's right.

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:41.988
Candy, you forget your loneliness by coming here,

00:05:42.269 --> 00:05:46.935
...and I forget my loneliness by keeping my
treasure with me.

00:05:47.554 --> 00:05:49.130
So, what is your treasure?

00:05:51.346 --> 00:05:53.282
Instead of telling, I'll show it to you later!

00:05:53.933 --> 00:05:57.754
-I've never shown it to anybody before!
-I wonder what it is!

00:05:59.020 --> 00:06:00.079
It's beginning!

00:06:08.688 --> 00:06:10.554
Everyone, be quiet!

00:06:14.608 --> 00:06:17.901
Now, everyone, I'd like to inform you
about the May festival.

00:06:19.577 --> 00:06:21.089
May festival?

00:06:21.475 --> 00:06:25.056
-Sister, when is it?
-Who will be flower-girls?

00:06:25.227 --> 00:06:26.138
Be quiet.

00:06:26.227 --> 00:06:30.784
Everyone, as you already know, this school
organizes festivals in May and October.

00:06:30.819 --> 00:06:33.480
-It's the first time for you, right?
-Yes.

00:06:33.515 --> 00:06:35.695
It's the only entertaining event in this school!

00:06:36.038 --> 00:06:38.922
It'll be the most splendid, fun day in a whole year!

00:06:38.923 --> 00:06:43.426
I'll call the names of those who will be flower-girls.
This year, all girls born in May will get that privilege.

00:06:43.427 --> 00:06:45.788
Maria... Mauren... Sylvia...

00:06:46.509 --> 00:06:51.323
My birthday is in May, as well.
It was Anthony's decision.

00:06:51.911 --> 00:06:53.341
It's from my own garden.

00:06:57.766 --> 00:07:01.356
I'll give you a much prettier
rose for your birthday.

00:07:03.510 --> 00:07:07.261
Thank you...
But my real birthday...

00:07:07.439 --> 00:07:10.717
Alright! Next time we meet,
let's make it your birthday.

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:12.222
Anthony.

00:07:18.827 --> 00:07:22.515
Okay? Next time we meet,
it's your birthday.

00:07:24.445 --> 00:07:26.679
And... on that day in May...

00:07:39.975 --> 00:07:42.628
It's blooming!
The new rose is blooming!

00:07:44.352 --> 00:07:47.560
Beautiful!
This is a new rose, right?

00:07:47.595 --> 00:07:48.909
How do you call it?

00:07:49.398 --> 00:07:50.652
Sweet Candy.

00:07:51.057 --> 00:07:52.111
Sweet Candy?

00:07:52.233 --> 00:07:57.473
I will give it to you as a present.
And today is your new birthday.

00:07:58.004 --> 00:07:59.737
Thank you, Anthony.

00:08:04.107 --> 00:08:05.152
Candy!

00:08:05.518 --> 00:08:06.515
Candy!

00:08:07.155 --> 00:08:08.677
Candy, you!

00:08:10.554 --> 00:08:13.534
Did you hear? Your name was called as well!

00:08:13.569 --> 00:08:14.662
Me, too?

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:21.492
So beautiful! You're lucky to have been born in May!
Flower-girls get to wear beautiful costumes!

00:08:28.034 --> 00:08:31.408
May festival is something wonderful!

00:08:32.622 --> 00:08:41.054
Cars decorated with flowers, carrying many flower-girls,
will parade alongside lined up boys!

00:08:41.151 --> 00:08:44.060
Everybody will be looking at them!

00:08:45.328 --> 00:08:50.171
And in the evening, at the dance party,
you'll be free to pick a partner!

00:08:50.498 --> 00:08:51.568
Partner?

00:08:58.780 --> 00:09:02.594
I'm so jealous because you have
a wonderful boyfriend...

00:09:06.114 --> 00:09:09.628
You have Stear and Archie, and I'm always alone.

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:13.716
Archie has Annie, but Stear...

00:09:14.106 --> 00:09:17.979
Patty, I'll ask Stear to be your partner!

00:09:18.199 --> 00:09:22.294
Stear...?
But... to become my partner...

00:09:22.915 --> 00:09:25.382
Don't worry! I'll ask him in your place!

00:09:26.050 --> 00:09:28.376
Really? Thank you, Candy!

00:09:28.792 --> 00:09:31.342
-But what about your partner?
-My partner?

00:09:37.132 --> 00:09:40.167
No! Just what was I thinking?

00:09:40.311 --> 00:09:43.789
There's no way that Terry would go out
to dance in such a loud, busy place!

00:09:45.196 --> 00:09:46.501
What's the matter, Candy?

00:09:47.331 --> 00:09:49.029
It's nothing!

00:09:49.104 --> 00:09:51.870
I'll find a suitable partner, don't worry!

00:09:52.051 --> 00:09:56.214
That's right! If you find someone, you
don't need to hide him from others!

00:09:56.461 --> 00:09:59.874
I'll invite my grandmother Marsha to the dance!

00:10:00.224 --> 00:10:02.537
Patty, we can invite someone?

00:10:02.538 --> 00:10:07.650
-Yes. We can invite as many friends as we want!
-Really?

00:10:08.807 --> 00:10:14.189
If I could, I would've invited sister Pony,
sister Lane, and all the children from Pony's home.

00:10:14.909 --> 00:10:16.735
But... it's impossible.

00:10:17.527 --> 00:10:22.417
That's right! I'll invite mr. Albert!
And grandfather William!

00:10:22.539 --> 00:10:24.423
Patty, see you later!

00:10:24.458 --> 00:10:25.885
What are you up to?

00:10:25.920 --> 00:10:28.153
I'll send invitations to my friends!

00:10:28.344 --> 00:10:29.920
You're so fast!

00:10:29.955 --> 00:10:33.228
I'd better send those invitations as soon as possible!
See you!

00:10:36.008 --> 00:10:38.681
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
You know, I really shouldn't be
translating anime at 4 AM.

00:10:45.609 --> 00:10:50.156
Grandfather William, who watches over me
and wants me to become a lady...

00:10:50.906 --> 00:10:53.734
My kind patron, grandfather William.

00:10:53.894 --> 00:10:56.538
Also, I'll invite Mr. Albert!

00:11:01.752 --> 00:11:05.633
What's going on with Terry?
I need to thank him for saving me.

00:11:05.966 --> 00:11:07.018
Just a moment, Candy!

00:11:08.036 --> 00:11:09.276
I want to have a word with you.

00:11:09.469 --> 00:11:12.391
Can't it wait?
I need to go somewhere.

00:11:12.846 --> 00:11:15.939
-You're going to Stear and Archie in boys' ward?
-No, I'm not!

00:11:16.165 --> 00:11:19.642
-I'm going to a beautiful place you know nothing about!
-What's up with that, you liar.

00:11:19.813 --> 00:11:22.289
-Are you calling me a liar?
-Yes, I am.

00:11:22.462 --> 00:11:26.113
How come you know that your birthday is in May
when you were dumped at the doorstep of Pony's home?

00:11:26.287 --> 00:11:29.081
That's right. Maybe you won't be a
flower-girl, after all?

00:11:30.984 --> 00:11:33.449
Haven't you two seen the school's name register?

00:11:33.592 --> 00:11:36.279
It clearly says that my birthday is in May!

00:11:37.521 --> 00:11:39.308
You can't know that for sure!

00:11:39.731 --> 00:11:43.964
Oh, you two are jealous because you didn't
get to become flower-girls!

00:11:44.169 --> 00:11:50.217
If you want to become flower-girls so much,
I can ask sisters to let you two join us!

00:11:50.603 --> 00:11:52.194
I'm sure you'd look lovely!

00:11:54.505 --> 00:11:56.467
I'm looking forward to May festival!

00:11:56.653 --> 00:11:58.912
And I need to hurry!
Excuse me!

00:12:01.842 --> 00:12:04.155
What a piece of work!
It's gone into her head!

00:12:04.570 --> 00:12:07.236
Just where is Candy rushing off to?

00:12:07.988 --> 00:12:11.040
I'm sure she's up to something.
Very well.

00:12:17.372 --> 00:12:20.730
-Is this deep enough?
-Okay.

00:12:21.161 --> 00:12:22.038
It's enough.

00:12:27.983 --> 00:12:30.357
That Terry guy is going to regret
for beating us up.

00:12:30.523 --> 00:12:31.783
We'll teach him.

00:12:35.455 --> 00:12:39.543
Maybe I'll find Terry atop the other Pony's hill?

00:12:53.603 --> 00:12:56.958
Kurin didn't come out to see me.
Somebody is nearby.

00:12:57.728 --> 00:13:00.008
If Terry isn't here...

00:13:00.921 --> 00:13:03.261
How long is she going to keep wandering around?

00:13:03.297 --> 00:13:05.319
The only place I haven't checked yet is the barn.

00:13:08.594 --> 00:13:09.990
Terry's coat!

00:13:10.808 --> 00:13:13.312
He must be somewhere around here!

00:13:17.284 --> 00:13:18.877
Eliza?

00:13:19.524 --> 00:13:22.919
So it was Eliza who kept
following me the whole time?

00:13:22.941 --> 00:13:24.325
I'd better watch my back.

00:13:24.431 --> 00:13:27.256
I can't meet Terry now. if I do, Eliza will
later make a whole circus out of this.

00:13:27.402 --> 00:13:30.439
But if Terry is nearby, I could thank him now!

00:13:31.238 --> 00:13:37.857
A-HA-HAAAA!!! THANK YOU FOR SAVING MEEE!!!
ME THANKS YOU FROM TEH BOTTOM OF MY HEART!!!

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:39.829
Don't yell like that, silly.

00:13:40.887 --> 00:13:44.290
She thanks me from the bottom of her heart?
...Candy.

00:13:45.213 --> 00:13:46.880
What was that?! That idiot!

00:13:48.664 --> 00:13:52.390
I followed her around all this time,
just to see her yell like that?!

00:13:59.138 --> 00:14:01.510
Somebody!
Help me!

00:14:02.421 --> 00:14:05.608
You held your nose up while walking,
and just look where it landed you!

00:14:06.455 --> 00:14:10.180
Who is that? Don't talk nonsense!
Quickly, let me out!

00:14:16.522 --> 00:14:20.507
You're never humble, even when you're
in such a position!

00:14:21.051 --> 00:14:23.913
Shut up!
Quickly, let me out!

00:14:26.296 --> 00:14:30.682
I'm not touching the worst punk in school.
I'll get my hands filthy!

00:14:30.842 --> 00:14:32.965
Oh! It doesn't bother me!

00:14:35.056 --> 00:14:37.085
You just stay there all night.

00:14:37.747 --> 00:14:39.937
People rarely go this way.

00:14:43.333 --> 00:14:45.093
Give me your hand...

00:14:49.444 --> 00:14:50.763
You're heavy!

00:14:52.408 --> 00:14:53.658
You're not hurt, aren't you?

00:14:54.429 --> 00:14:56.193
Princess, you're safe now.

00:15:00.003 --> 00:15:01.164
Filthy!

00:15:08.607 --> 00:15:11.378
So it was you who dug this hole?

00:15:12.676 --> 00:15:15.330
What a way to thank me!
See, that's a terrible false accusation!

00:15:15.564 --> 00:15:17.601
Who dug it up then?

00:15:17.771 --> 00:15:20.068
You know that coward, Neil Leagan?

00:15:20.718 --> 00:15:22.567
Neil is completely unlike you!

00:15:27.957 --> 00:15:30.960
Both are quick to blame others,
I didn't expect anything else.

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:49.383
Terrius.

00:15:49.554 --> 00:15:50.429
That punk!

00:15:55.768 --> 00:15:57.410
And yet, he acted like a gentleman...

00:15:57.623 --> 00:15:58.840
You're not hurt, aren't you?

00:15:59.123 --> 00:16:01.140
I still feel it...

00:16:01.141 --> 00:16:02.838
Princess, you're safe now.

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:11.946
That's right, I heard that he's a nobleman
who lives in a big castle.

00:16:12.183 --> 00:16:14.727
A nobleman... there aren't any in America.

00:16:15.246 --> 00:16:17.757
I wouldn't mind dancing with him at the May festival.

00:16:24.781 --> 00:16:25.901
Say, Candy...

00:16:27.148 --> 00:16:30.391
As I promised, I'll show you my secret treasure!

00:16:31.252 --> 00:16:33.345
Well, Patty? What is your treasure?

00:16:33.516 --> 00:16:36.394
Let me give you a hint.

00:16:39.625 --> 00:16:45.251
You see, I'm an only child. As far as my memory
goes, my parents were always away or busy.

00:16:45.439 --> 00:16:48.283
I had noone but little birds and dogs to talk to.

00:16:48.968 --> 00:16:53.427
And then they sent me to this boarding school.
At first I was unbearably lonely!

00:16:55.865 --> 00:17:00.160
My secret treasure is something that helped me
to fight off this loneliness.

00:17:00.534 --> 00:17:03.204
I only want to show it to you!

00:17:03.522 --> 00:17:07.602
Patty, I'll be waiting for you in my room!

00:17:08.351 --> 00:17:12.647
The light is on in Stear and Archie's room.
There is light in Terry's room, too!

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:16.729
Unusual things happen, I guess.

00:17:18.766 --> 00:17:20.131
May festival.

00:17:21.409 --> 00:17:22.856
Archie and Annie.

00:17:23.205 --> 00:17:24.476
Stear and Patty!

00:17:25.886 --> 00:17:27.275
And I...

00:17:27.423 --> 00:17:28.963
Patricia O'Brien!

00:17:30.229 --> 00:17:31.832
I'm sorry, sister!

00:17:32.203 --> 00:17:33.053
Patty!

00:17:33.279 --> 00:17:34.838
Forgive me!

00:17:34.875 --> 00:17:38.330
When did you get that thing?
Get rid of it! Immediately!

00:17:39.437 --> 00:17:40.320
Patty!

00:17:40.634 --> 00:17:41.580
Candy!

00:17:43.268 --> 00:17:44.343
Patty!

00:17:46.365 --> 00:17:47.434
I wanted to...

00:17:48.361 --> 00:17:50.423
I wanted to show Yuli to you!

00:17:50.776 --> 00:17:56.173
I just wanted you to meet my friend Yuli!

00:17:57.418 --> 00:17:58.517
Patty.

00:17:58.901 --> 00:18:02.234
That faint-hearted Patty went against
the rules by doing something like this...

00:18:02.235 --> 00:18:03.766
It takes more than ordinary courage to do this.

00:18:03.879 --> 00:18:05.359
Patricia O'Brien!

00:18:06.789 --> 00:18:09.202
You always were an eminent student.

00:18:09.203 --> 00:18:12.663
You will get rid of that turtle and you will spend a day
reconsidering your actions in the contemplation room.

00:18:14.208 --> 00:18:15.962
If you do that, you will be excused.

00:18:16.272 --> 00:18:19.155
I could never leave Yuli!

00:18:20.352 --> 00:18:29.745
Sister Gray... Yuli is just like me...
weak... cowardly... exactly like me!

00:18:31.408 --> 00:18:32.666
Get rid of it!

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:38.545
Forgive me, Yuli!

00:18:38.546 --> 00:18:40.044
Please, don't make me leave him...

00:18:40.079 --> 00:18:44.924
Everyone, return to your rooms!
It's almost lights-out time!

00:18:50.495 --> 00:18:53.559
Sister Gray, do you insist on getting
rid of the turtle?

00:18:53.764 --> 00:18:56.708
Of course!
Animals are banned by regulations!

00:18:56.709 --> 00:18:59.653
Not to mention that it's a hideous turtle!

00:19:00.434 --> 00:19:05.559
It may seem filthy to you, but to Patty,
it's a precious pet!

00:19:05.560 --> 00:19:06.447
Candy!

00:19:06.550 --> 00:19:10.933
Why don't you listen to her reasons for having it?
Regulations, regulations...

00:19:10.968 --> 00:19:13.073
That's why this school is so cold!

00:19:15.349 --> 00:19:16.903
Anything else to say?

00:19:17.298 --> 00:19:21.201
Even though this creature was created by God,
you don't have any affection towards it?

00:19:21.202 --> 00:19:23.873
One who doesn't love animals,
doesn't love humans as well!

00:19:24.691 --> 00:19:28.606
Just where would she throw away Yuli?
There is no food or water around here!

00:19:29.231 --> 00:19:32.486
-You want it to simply die?
-Yuli...

00:19:32.606 --> 00:19:34.024
Regulations are regulations.

00:19:34.155 --> 00:19:38.615
I make sure that nobody goes against those
regulations, and I intend to keep doing that way.

00:19:38.799 --> 00:19:40.293
Patricia, get rid of it!

00:19:41.083 --> 00:19:43.025
Why, you stubborn old...!

00:19:47.726 --> 00:19:49.595
Candice White Adley!

00:19:49.795 --> 00:19:56.416
You are banned from participating in the May festival,
during which you will be confined to the contemplation room!

00:19:59.095 --> 00:20:01.028
I can't go to the May festival.

00:20:01.637 --> 00:20:03.759
And I already invited grandfather William.

00:20:04.102 --> 00:20:05.842
Mr. Albert is coming, too.

00:20:06.745 --> 00:20:08.288
I finally invited them!

00:20:08.471 --> 00:20:11.377
Quickly, apologize!
Candy, apologize!

00:20:12.222 --> 00:20:15.227
I wonder will sister Gray forgive me
if I apologize now.

00:20:15.701 --> 00:20:18.188
If I apologize now... now!

00:20:20.954 --> 00:20:23.575
No, I haven't said anything wrong.

00:20:23.837 --> 00:20:27.312
God loves animals the same way He loves humans.

00:20:28.045 --> 00:20:29.126
Sister Gray.

00:20:29.184 --> 00:20:31.161
Am I going to hear your apology?

00:20:31.382 --> 00:20:33.394
No. I won't apologize.

00:20:34.800 --> 00:20:40.570
However, it's true that you're a stubborn,
inflexible person. I really meant that.

00:20:42.673 --> 00:20:43.635
Oh, no!

00:20:43.636 --> 00:20:46.266
Very well!
Both of you are confined to the contemplation rooms!

00:20:46.267 --> 00:20:50.886
Patricia only for one night,
and Candice - until the May festival is over!

00:20:50.946 --> 00:20:51.979
You understand?

00:20:55.054 --> 00:21:00.541
Candy finally managed to upset sister Gray.

00:21:17.213 --> 00:21:20.167
To be continued...
